    <li>Amazon, "The new Amazon Kindle lineup" (aboutamazon.com), Oct 1, 2026: covers, Page-Turn Cover, dock, Kindle Click.</li>
    <li>WIRED, "Amazon's New Kindle Lineup Is Lighter, Thinner, and More Metal," Oct 1, 2026; Gizmodo, Oct 1, 2026; The Verge, Oct 1, 2026: 2026 body details, power button, pogo pins.</li>
    <li>Amazon.com listing for Kindle Paperwhite 16 GB (12th Generation, 2024), checked {FACTS_AS_OF}: dimensions, weight, IPX8.</li>
    <li>Retailer listings for Amazon's 2024 Paperwhite fabric cover: fit notes.</li>
    <li>Amazon press release, Sept 21, 2021, and PCWorld's 2021 review; Amazon's 11th-generation fabric cover listing: 2021 specs and fit note.</li>
    <li>Amazon's 2018 Paperwhite technical sheet and press release; CNET and Pocket-lint 2018 coverage: 2018 specs, cover weight.</li>
  </ul>

